{"id":"27c0dae5e99886dd","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-recursive-winning-strategy-code.md","title":"ZFC Recursive Winning Strategy Code","display":"df-zfc-recursive-winning-strategy-code — ZFC Recursive Winning Strategy Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursive-winning-strategy-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursive-winning-strategy-code"],"display":"df-zfc-recursive-winning-strategy-code — ZFC Recursive Winning Strategy Code","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-recursive.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursive-winning-strategy-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursive-winning-strategy-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursive-winning-strategy-code — ZFC Recursive Winning Strategy Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b74c79bf773960d3\" href=\"?note=b74c79bf773960d3\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md\">../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md\">../batch07/58-df-recursive.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da76983f71a491b6\" href=\"?note=da76983f71a491b6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,G,A,i\\in V\">\\(\\sigma,G,A,i\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Strategy}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b74c79bf773960d3\" href=\"?note=b74c79bf773960d3\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md\">../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md</a> 的四元策略谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md\">../batch07/58-df-recursive.md</a> 的总递归函数类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a> 的固定编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"da76983f71a491b6\" href=\"?note=da76983f71a491b6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md</a> 的有效支付集谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RecursivePayoff}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{RecursivePayoff}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWinningStrategyCode}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWinningStrategyCode}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s)\n\\qquad(s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s)\n\\qquad(s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RecursivePayoff}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S(A,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RecursivePayoff}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S(A,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}code} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWinningStrategyCode}_S(\\sigma,G,A,i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\ni\\in 2\\land\nG=\\langle\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A\\rangle\\land A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\n\\operatorname{RecursivePayoff}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,i,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},\\omega)\\land\n\\exists r\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;\\left[\n\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\sigma(s)=r(\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(s))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\left(\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\bmod2=i\\to x(n)=\\sigma(x\\upharpoonright n))\n\\to((i=0\\land x\\in A)\\lor(i=1\\land x\\notin A))\n\\right)\\right]\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}code} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWinningStrategyCode}_S(\\sigma,G,A,i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\ni\\in 2\\land\nG=\\langle\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A\\rangle\\land A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\n\\operatorname{RecursivePayoff}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,i,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},\\omega)\\land\n\\exists r\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;\\left[\n\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\sigma(s)=r(\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(s))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\left(\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\bmod2=i\\to x(n)=\\sigma(x\\upharpoonright n))\n\\to((i=0\\land x\\in A)\\lor(i=1\\land x\\notin A))\n\\right)\\right]\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原兼容名称与参数顺序；有限历史的数值编码及支付集条件均有内部定义。</li>\n<li>递归性仍作用于一个总递归数值实现子；获胜条件仍量化所有相容的无限对局。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md","status":"resolved","id":"b74c79bf773960d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-recursive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a7e1b630ead60caa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"da76983f71a491b6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set